SUMMARY -- the galaxy ceiling and how far modelling freedom can push it
================================================================================================================

                                                   variant      BTFR       RAR   ceiling
     AM / NFW / c(M) standard   [the CDM-appropriate case]    0.1053    0.2668    0.1053
                                        AM / NFW / c x 0.5    0.3977    0.5609    0.3977
                                        AM / NFW / c x 2.0    0.0478    0.0354    0.0354
                                 AM / Burkert cored / c(M)      none    0.1427    0.1427
         CS / NFW / c(M)          [mass-INDEPENDENT ratio]      none      none      none
